      "message": "Host command battery_display_soc was not checking the flags until cl:3496464. But this change can block getting the static values of full_factor and shutdown_soc (see cl:3503397). So cl:3515274 reverts cl:3496464, which means the flags will not be checked in battery_display_soc.",
