      "side": 1,
      "message": "oooh... subtle!\n\nif i understand this correctly, the real problem isn\u0027t\nthat data value fields are getting zero\u0027d out, but rather\nflags is getting zero\u0027d out, thus loosing previously\naccumulated \"invalid\" flags like BATT_FLAG_BAD_REMAINING_CAPACITY.\nthe result being that invalid data fields are getting\npromoted to valid fields without fresh data.",
      "revId": "3419740f3a406ddb2761933a347bd71b1466579a",
